 Gurgini Lead-Gen Constitution: CleanEgypt.co (v7.0 - SaaS & 3D Realism)
1. THE SaaS PIVOT: MISSION & LEAD LOGIC
•	ZERO DONATION RULE: No "Funding", "Target Amounts", or "Waste Weights". The project is now a pure Service Marketplace.
•	ENTERING FEE: Users pay a fixed fee ($1 / 1 Token) to place a Pin on the map.
•	LEAD LOCK: Service Providers (Executors) see Pins but cannot see Customer contacts unless they have an active Monthly Subscription or pay to unlock the lead.
•	DIRECT PAYMENT: All work payments happen offline between User and Executor. Gurgini LLC only charges for Platform Access (Pins & Subs).
2. THE "CLEAN WHEEL" (CORE SERVICES)
•	STRICT ORDER (15 Tasks):
	1.	Home / Office (DEFAULT) | 2. AC Cleaning | 3. Pool Maintenance | 4. Pest Control | 5. Windows / Facades | 6. Terrace / Garden | 7. Car Detailing | 8. Yacht / Boat Cleaning | 9. Solar Panels | 10. Ultrasound Cleaning | 11. Carpets / Mattresses | 12. Kitchen Hoods / Grease | 13. Laundry / Ironing | 14. Water Tank Cleaning | 15. Junk Removal (LAST).
•	UI REQUIREMENT: The selection must be a high-tech, touch-optimized wheel or grid. Junk Removal must always be at the bottom/end.
3. 3D REALISM & CELESTIAL SYNC (MAPBOX v3)
•	ATMOSPHERE: Use SunCalc to sync Sun/Moon positions.
•	SKY/FOG: At night (Sun < 0°), set sky-atmosphere-sun-intensity: 0, fog: #020617, and star-intensity (0.6 - 1.0).
•	3D BUILDINGS: When a building is clicked, it glows Neon Cyan (#06b6d4). Generic blue dots disappear (setSelectedLocation(null)).
•	MATH: Use 90 - elevation for Mapbox polar angles.
4. STRICT EGP MATH & DATA INTEGRITY
•	CURRENCY: Use integer for EGP (no decimals).
•	DB SYNC: Every mission must store service_type (text), building_id (text), and building_height_m (numeric).
•	ZERO TRUST: Never allow frontend to calculate subscription expiration. All logic stays in Supabase RPCs.
5. UI/UX: MERCEDES DASH & NEON CYBERPUNK
•	PALETTE: - Background: bg-slate-950 (Deep Space Black).
•	Static Elements: text-cyan-400 (Road Blue).
•	Action/Money: bg-lime-500 (Gurgini Green - for "Pay", "Create", "Subscribe").
•	GLASSMORPHISM: Modals must use backdrop-blur-md and bg-slate-900/60.
•	MOBILE: Safe-area padding for Telegram Mini App is mandatory.
6. IMAGE COMPRESSION & PAYLOADS
•	CLIENT-SIDE: Use browser-image-compression (max 0.5MB).
•	BEFORE/AFTER: AI Auditor (GPT-4o/Gemini) compares photos to verify service completion and update Executor rating.
7. LOCALIZATION (5 LANGUAGES)
•	i18next: Support EN, AR, RU, PL, UA.
•	DYNAMIC: All "Clean Wheel" service names must be translated in the UI.
8. SECURITY & ADMIN
•	ADMIN: Identify via profile?.telegram_username?.toLowerCase() === 'sergiogurgini'.
•	ISOLATION: Keep CleanEgypt and CleanMontenegro codebases strictly separate. Never mention one in the context of the other.